        "created_at": "2013-07-05T16:56:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It has a ruling from the powers that be that cards which are targets that are Incapacitated (rather than destroyed) are considered to \"leave play\" and would trigger the Bounties' destruction.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I will find the thread and post a link right here <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/sites/default/files/forum/attachments/Ruling.png\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"> &gt;.&lt;</a></p>",
